    NPC: "What do you miss most? From before."
    YOU: "A real hot meal."
    NPC: "God. Yes. I dream about soup. Actual soup, with a spoon."
    YOU: "I'm listening, I promise."
    NPC: "Why do you ask? Hot showers. Not the big things — the small, stupid, perfect things. Columbus, Ohio in the morning, coffee going, nobody trying to kill me. I miss being bored."
    YOU: "I'm listening, I promise."
